    <!-- Subscription terms text, appears at the bottom of the subscriptions screen -->
    <string name="PaymentChooserActivity.SubscriptionsTerms">Kanzura subscription yako chero nguva muchikamu chesubscriptions paGoogle Play. Paunokanzura subscription yako, uchararasa kuwana kune premium features dzinopihwa nemitemo yesubscription pakupera kwenguva yekubhadhara yamanje. Kuedza mahara kumwechete chete pamunhu. Pakupera kwenguva yako yekuedza mahara, uchakwenenzwa otomatiki mari iri mumitemo yesubscription yako. Kuti urege kukwenenzwa, kanzura subscription nguva isati yapera yekuedza.</string>

    <!-- Time pass explanation text -->
